    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go back through the exchange around Saving on the Bartender line by line and unpack how the Russian works.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Я просто делал свою работу.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I was just doing my job.' Kostya tries to defend himself, arguing that he was merely performing his regular duties.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Мы экономим на всём.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We are saving on everything.' Nagiyev bluntly explains that the entire place is cutting costs right now.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Мы сэкономили на бармене.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We saved on the bartender.' He ruthlessly announces that the bar is the latest place they are trimming the fat.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Вы не можете меня уволить.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You cannot fire me.' Kostya can hardly believe it, claiming the boss has no right to do this.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Ты уволен, балбес.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are fired, idiot.' Nagiyev insults him and confirms the termination without any sympathy.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Балбес, да?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'An idiot, huh?' Kostya is taken aback by the harsh name-calling.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Это очень несправедливо.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is very unfair.' He protests the decision, feeling completely wronged by the sudden move.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Ресторан в трудном положении.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The restaurant is in a difficult situation.' Nagiyev justifies the cuts by pointing out the dire financial state of the business.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Кто будет наливать напитки?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Who will pour drinks?' Kostya tries to appeal to logic, asking who will handle the bar if he leaves.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Это больше не твоя проблема.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is no longer your problem.' Nagiyev coldly brushes off the concern, stating it does not concern the bartender anymore.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Хорошо, я уйду сегодня.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Fine, I will leave today.' Kostya finally accepts his fate, agreeing to pack up and leave.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
